Java

JVM, JRE, JDK
Java class loaders 
	Bootstrap class loader - Loading java.util and java.lang packages
	Platform class loader - Loading platform specific classed and Java SE APIs (e.g., java.sql)
	System / Application class loader - Load classes from application class path
OOPs concepts - Abstraction, Encapsulation, Inheritance, Polymorphism,
SOLID principles
	Single reason principle - A class should be for single reason. For example, Student class should have only student related information and it shouldn’t have teacher related information.
	Open/Closed principle - A class is open for extend but closed for modification.
	Liskov principle - Subclass should be substitutable with it’s super class
	Dependency Inversion  - Abstraction
Interface vs Abstract
